; AurumFunded - Instant Funding PRO (no challenge, no target, no daily limit, no consistency rule; maximum loss 10%
; of the starting balance, tightened for good to 5% once the account is 5% up; first payout 14 days after the first
; trade once +5% and the lock is in, then weekly; rules read on instantfunding.com 2026-10-15; confirm their EA
; policy and the broker's server clock (the EA wants New York + 7) before buying).
; Guard: final stop at -8.5% until equity first reaches +5%, then at -3.5% for good (InpPropLock*), 1.5% inside the
; firm's lines; own day stop 3%; size 0.5 with the cushion rule. tools/prop_instantfunding.py, 70% of the edge:
; first payout within 1 / 2 / 3 months 20 / 41 / 57%, median 2.5 months, none lost; half the edge with pessimistic
; intraday dips: median 3.9 months, none lost.  Size 0.7: median 2.0 months, 6.7% lost at half the edge.
; Account Drawdown: the firm closes everything when open positions lose a set % of the starting balance together
; (2% in their help page's example; first time the split drops to 50%, second time the account is lost). Ask them the
; PRO figure and set InpPropFloatPct about 0.3 below it, so the EA closes first; 1.7 assumes their 2%.
; Weekend holding needs their add-on; this preset's legs close before the weekend (grid and gold hold are off).
InpPropTargetPct=0.0
InpPropRound=1
InpPropMinDays=0
InpPropDayStopPct=3.0
InpPropMaxStopPct=8.5
InpPropTrailing=false
InpPropLockPct=5.0
InpPropLockStopPct=3.5
InpPropFloatPct=1.7
InpPropRoomPct=8.5
InpPropCap=1.4
InpPropResetHHMM=0
InpEuClock=true
InpSizeMult=0.5
InpGridRiskPct=0.0
InpHoldVolPct=0.0
